    "id": "s2med-0034",
    "category": "IM Cardio",
    "q": "How does mitral regurgitation relate to rheumatic heart disease?",
    "a": "Seen acutely in rheumatic heart disease; the valve scars over years and later becomes mitral stenosis.",
